  "foaf:name": "Marine Innovation Hub - Ghana",
  "sdo:name": "Marine Innovation Hub - Ghana",
  "sdo:description": "The Marine Innovation Hub - Ghana is a collaborative initiative dedicated to the advancement of climate mitigation efforts across the West African coastline. In partnership with stakeholders across the West Africa, the Hub aims to democratize knowledge on ocean-based efforts to help address the growing impacts of climate change. With our positionality in Ghana, the Hub will bring together a diverse community of academia, government, local communities and NGOs to work towards a common goal of ocean action and preservation. The Hub&#x27;s primary mission is to identify, support and collaborate with relevant partners to design and implement ocean initiatives including marine carbon removal techniques. Through this codependent approach, the Hub aims to aid in the compilation of research, the democratization of knowledge on ocean initiatives, the development of practical interventions and the implementation of scalable solutions focus on enhancing climate resilience.",
